	)
	(text "D4 HIGH (boot, idle): relay off. Firmware RELAY_ACTIVE_LOW true.\nQ4 base (5 - 0.7) V / 2.2k = 2 mA for a 72 mA coil (forced beta 36).\nContacts 10 A / 28 VDC, potential-free. Fail-secure strike: J4 +12V -> COM,\nlock between NO and J4 GND (use NC for a fail-safe maglock).\nFit a 1N4007 across the lock coil itself."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.73 224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6b4b8ccb-b623-5158-9d01-a40e68955b39")
	)
	(text "D3 HIGH (boot, idle): Q1 on, Q2 off, silent.\nD3 LOW: buzzer on. Firmware BUZZER_ACTIVE_LOW true."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "92fdec53-90d4-5107-a647-3bafef3e6c3c")
	)
	(text "Plugs into two 1x8 female headers.\nBoot straps: D3/GPIO0 and D4/GPIO2 HIGH, D8/GPIO15 LOW at reset.\nThe D1 mini pulls D3/D4 up with 10k; the 47k base resistors\nhere leave them at ~2.8 V (VIH 2.5 V). USB may stay plugged in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ae988e12-8cbf-5d71-a766-5bd68ea7aaf2")
	)
	(text "BUZZER DRIVER (silent at boot)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.9882 130.495 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b2b1de1c-5230-5983-80b0-8f30dee6cb66")
	)
	(text "U1 R-78E5.0-1.0: switching 12 V -> 5 V, 1 A, ~90 % efficient (a 7805 would\nburn ~3 W here). Peak load ~0.5 A: D1 mini + Wi-Fi 0.35 A, relay 72 mA, buzzer 30 mA.\nD1 blocks a reversed supply; F1 trips on a shorted lock cable. C1/C2 within 10 mm of U1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e3c3126f-cdc0-518a-85f9-e91088236abc")
	)
